Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.90,0:00:03.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.04,0:00:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the deal with this bear?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.90,0:00:12.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.08,0:00:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.22,0:00:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.54,0:00:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't usually see the director of\Nthe Hunters Association around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.40,0:00:20.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.31,0:00:23.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, you must be the magical tool\Neveryone keeps going on about.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.80,0:00:24.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He really can talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.90,0:00:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A bear in charge of hunters? Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.08,0:00:30.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're planning to attack\Nthe frog fiends at a nearby
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.24,0:00:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,base to lessen the threat\Nthey pose to the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.90,0:00:35.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can we count on you and\NBoxo for your support?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.94,0:00:38.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He didn't mean to include me, did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.34,0:00:40.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.25,0:00:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo's no good in a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.26,0:00:42.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I figured.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.44,0:00:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's nothing more valuable\Nto hunters on the road than warm,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.68,0:00:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ready-to-eat food.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.08,0:00:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to mention the supply of\Ncold drinks for the long marches.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.42,0:00:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I said support, I meant it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.10,0:00:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't worry about Boxxo, I'll\Nmake doubly sure he's well guarded
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.70,0:00:59.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Boxxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.18,0:01:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sound like something you can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.94,0:01:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't really know what's going on,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.76,0:01:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it doesn't feel like\Nsomething I can ignore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.42,0:01:07.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to protect this village and Lamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.36,0:01:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.74,0:01:11.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, looks like we're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.72,0:01:13.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect, thanks you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.06,0:01:23.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This moment is called the.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.06,0:01:25.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The time of the song.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.42,0:01:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't stop the drama.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.98,0:01:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you face, when you\Nface, don't stop believing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.98,0:01:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you face, when you\Nface, don't stop believing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.02,0:01:42.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you face, don't stop believing.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.20,0:01:46.50,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(773,1)\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine, {\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.00,0:01:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you face, you're just like.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.06,0:02:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.10,0:02:50.02,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(100,55)\fad(734,768)\fscx82}The King Frog Fiend Appears
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.30,0:02:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been three days now\Nsince Lamas and I set out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.18,0:02:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Word among the hunters is we're getting\Npretty close to the Frog Fiend's base.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.60,0:02:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to Director Bear,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.10,0:02:58.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Frog Fiends probably couldn't do\Nmuch damage to the village directly,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.48,0:03:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but they could block its access\Nto the stratum's transfer circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.84,0:03:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The transfer circle is apparently\Nsome kind of magic device that
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.46,0:03:08.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,connects the Clearflow Lake stratum\Nwith all the dungeon's other strata,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.94,0:03:10.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as well as the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.46,0:03:12.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, no way is that them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.88,0:03:14.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.30,0:03:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's that special time\Nof year again, Shiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.44,0:03:17.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You thinking what I'm thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.62,0:03:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty sure I am, Aka.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.50,0:03:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the season of money and we're\Ngoing to load our pockets with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.72,0:03:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They seem excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.28,0:03:26.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Munami was saying the frog fiends are such
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.18,0:03:28.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a hassle because of\Ntheir seasonal breeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.50,0:03:31.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wake up one morning and\Nsuddenly there are a bunch of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.34,0:03:32.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.46,0:03:36.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently there are way more frog fiends\Nthis year than a usual breeding season.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.90,0:03:37.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.81,0:03:38.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It shouldn't be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.90,0:03:40.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, look at this team.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.48,0:03:43.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.04,0:03:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to be so tense\Nyou know it's like director
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.96,0:03:56.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bear promised you've got\Nplenty of muscle guarding
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.44,0:04:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you so there's no need to\Nworry right this is the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.88,0:04:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,magic endless food box right\Nthis thing's got quite a
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.48,0:04:07.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,reputation in the village\Nhis name's box oh and if you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.56,0:04:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,put some coins in him you\Ncan buy anything you see in
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.00,0:04:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the window no way that's\Nconvenient I can't exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.02,0:04:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,walk away from something like\Nthis without trying it out
Dialogue: 1,0:04:15.73,0:04:19.23,sign_1513_19_Kokuuma_Cream_of,text (right side),0,0,0,,{\an9\c&HC3EBF4&\3c&H759AEA&\fs20}Kokuuma Cream of Corn Soup
Dialogue: 1,0:04:15.98,0:04:19.19,sign_29945_459_Oden,text (left side),0,0,0,,{\an7\fs30}Oden
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.36,0:04:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see. Oh, I think I'm\Ngonna try this one with a
Dialogue: 1,0:04:19.94,0:04:22.94,sign_2664_34_Megumi_Natural_W,text (left side),0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H7CA3C5&\3c&H93E4F8&\fs25}Early Afternoon Tea
Dialogue: 1,0:04:19.94,0:04:22.94,sign_2664_34_Megumi_Natural_W,text (right side),0,0,0,,{\an9\c&HB3C1CE&\3c&HE3F1FD&\fs25}Kocha Kadan
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.12,0:04:24.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,picture that looks like a\Nsliced lomawa thank you very
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.06,0:04:30.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much you talk oh man this\Nis weird I gotta say though
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.94,0:04:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed never had an\Nexperience quite like this
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.92,0:04:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this is an incredibly detailed\Npicture too there's no
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.36,0:04:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,way somebody did all this\Non their own come to think
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.72,0:04:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of it I've never looked at\Nthe pictures that much it's
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.06,0:04:44.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kind of hard when the empty\Ncontainers disappear oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.42,0:04:46.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't worry about\Nthe trash, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.40,0:04:47.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.44,0:04:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I gotta see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.04,0:04:52.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.00,0:04:54.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's really good!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.44,0:04:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's warm, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.64,0:04:56.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.94,0:05:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna drink a lot of these,\Nso make sure you stock up, okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:59.90,0:05:03.82,sign_2664_34_Megumi_Natural_W,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs25\c&H7A9CB9&\3c&H7AD2EB&}Early Afternoon Tea
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.38,0:05:03.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, as far as I can tell, we\Ndon't have to do any restocking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.92,0:05:06.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We buy and we buy, but he never runs dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.64,0:05:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty weird, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.36,0:05:09.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.60,0:05:12.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I might know someone\Nelse who'd like to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.50,0:05:15.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Filmina, you gotta come see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.94,0:05:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, here I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.38,0:05:18.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it, Captain Kerioyl?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.04,0:05:21.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're telling me Stubble\Nis the leader of the guards?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.74,0:05:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had the wrong read on this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.56,0:05:25.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must be serious. Okay, Filmina,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.94,0:05:28.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to use all your knowledge\Nabout ancient treasures and
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.50,0:05:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,magic tools to unlock the mysteries\Nof this wonderful little box.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.98,0:05:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There don't appear to be any mysteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.16,0:05:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing magic about this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.60,0:05:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a block of iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.70,0:05:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.84,0:05:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a vending machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.98,0:05:52.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never met any other\Nblock of iron that can
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.96,0:05:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sell you a warm drink\Nfrom an endless supply.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.00,0:05:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think it's keeping this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.08,0:05:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another dimension?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.82,0:05:59.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Potentially.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.73,0:06:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But an effect like that would have to be\Nthe result of quite an unusual blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.72,0:06:06.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I can't imagine a blessing would\Nwork on something without a soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.02,0:06:08.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,such as this box.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.48,0:06:09.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.64,0:06:12.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I could tell them how wrong she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.10,0:06:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to my magic\Nexpert, you are very strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.10,0:06:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doesn't trouble me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.32,0:06:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as you're here\Nto help, I could use you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.28,0:06:20.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So thanks, Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.72,0:06:22.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're real glad to have you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.62,0:06:23.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.06,0:06:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.14,0:06:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are relieved for the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.06,0:06:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourselves for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.80,0:06:33.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now's my chance to earn\Nsome repeat business.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.22,0:06:36.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.14,0:06:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.74,0:06:43.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to thank the hunters\Nfor earning me so many points.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.24,0:06:45.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I added a new function.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.62,0:06:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.76,0:06:50.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel the chill in my bones\Nmelting away with every bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.50,0:06:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what this meat is,\Nbut I can't get enough of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.86,0:06:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nights and mornings are\Ngetting pretty cold these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.20,0:06:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and nothing farts a\Nchill like cup noodles.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.28,0:07:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It tastes so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.28,0:07:05.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every flavor I've had has been incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.14,0:07:08.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to try the rest of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.40,0:07:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure that\Ngirl's one of the guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.10,0:07:13.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She eats a lot for someone so small.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.12,0:07:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your stomach's like a\Nbottomless pit, I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.72,0:07:19.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm just getting started, trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.40,0:07:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I almost forgot to introduce myself, I'm\NLammis. Right. Good to meet you. I'm Shui.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.68,0:07:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May I join you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.40,0:07:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Director.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.20,0:07:33.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to talk with you about tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.04,0:07:36.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got about three hours\Nof marching in the morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.64,0:07:39.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but after that, we'll launch\Nour attack on the Frog Fiends.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.92,0:07:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I brought you along to provide food.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.96,0:07:44.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any other decisions are yours to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.44,0:07:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said, would you prefer to wait\Nhere or join us on the battlefield?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.50,0:07:52.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, Boxo's not a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.60,0:07:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am so normally I wouldn't mind it's\Njust I really don't think he wants me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.70,0:08:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drag him out there too bad are you\Ntelling me you want me to drag you out?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.26,0:08:08.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There hello there well that settles\Nit director it looks like box so and
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.14,0:08:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me will Be joining you on the\Nbattlefield I knew I could count on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.96,0:08:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm stronger than you think, Lamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.78,0:08:23.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're my first customer\Nand my first friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.82,0:08:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise I'm going to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.38,0:08:32.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The air's like a dog's mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.48,0:08:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the ground's all muddy, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.14,0:08:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's really hard to walk in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.82,0:08:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're right on top of them! Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.44,0:08:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready when you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.62,0:08:52.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then, let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.02,0:08:56.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's stack some bodies, people!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.84,0:08:59.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bigger the pile of rocks,\Nthe bigger the pile of gold!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.76,0:09:00.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.92,0:09:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's our time to shine,\NBoxo, are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.38,0:09:04.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.80,0:09:08.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, didn't Lana say\Nshe's really bad at landing hits?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.28,0:09:09.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's this gonna work?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.68,0:09:13.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.62,0:09:17.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I actually hit it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.72,0:09:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, I hit it good, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.98,0:09:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like the extra weight\Non her back is balancing her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.02,0:09:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it be we make the perfect team?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.74,0:09:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure I figured\Nout what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.06,0:09:31.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Boxo. Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.66,0:09:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.32,0:09:37.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although I never would have guessed\Nthis was one of my functions.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.52,0:09:45.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rise, water.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.60,0:09:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take shape to my will and pierce them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.46,0:09:56.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's off about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.78,0:09:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way there should\Nbe this many of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.92,0:10:01.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's starting to look\Nlike the rumors were true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.92,0:10:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shuckle up, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.20,0:10:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things are getting serious, so\Npick someone and watch their back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.50,0:10:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.68,0:10:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.86,0:10:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So which is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.96,0:10:11.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was this your bad\Nplanning or your bad luck?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.94,0:10:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can whine later.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.82,0:10:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it starts to feel like we're\Ngonna lose, we can ditch the wagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.60,0:10:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not giving up just yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.04,0:10:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, thanks for looking out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.52,0:10:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't sweat it, it was easy enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.34,0:10:27.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.20,0:10:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay away from her!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.28,0:10:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what's up with this light?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.38,0:10:36.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know you could do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.88,0:10:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.88,0:10:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna complain about it, but it\Nwould be nice to know how it's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.94,0:10:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.68,0:10:47.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd better revisit the function\Nthat widens my field of view.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:47.50,0:10:51.71,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur9\t(1,355,\blur0)\an2\frz-2.52\pos(305,70)\fs40}Omnidirectional Vision
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.84,0:10:48.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.84,0:10:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A thousand points seemed so expensive\Nwhen I was sitting at the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.24,0:10:53.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a difference!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.94,0:10:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see everything at once now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.04,0:10:59.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Voxo, keep an eye out for\Nenemies back there, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.46,0:11:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could even win a reward. Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.32,0:11:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you say that, there's an enemy coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.36,0:11:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's get out there\Nand turn this around.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.48,0:11:07.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.50,0:11:08.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got quite a punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.00,0:11:11.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen someone lay\Nout a frog being barehanded.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.94,0:11:13.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's pretty impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.42,0:11:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain, don't say that,\NI'm really nothing special.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.34,0:11:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can win a reward!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.52,0:11:20.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo! I thought you'd say how\Nbig it is, everywhere for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.74,0:11:23.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to tell you about the enemies!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.24,0:11:28.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget about the punching,\Nhow'd you do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.02,0:11:30.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A blessing of the Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.24,0:11:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The same thing happened a second ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.10,0:11:33.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think Baxo's doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.06,0:11:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Baxo's doing it? Well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.02,0:11:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anybody so\Nobviously up to no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.88,0:11:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to upgrade him to\Npotentially dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.54,0:11:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo, I think you and I are\Ngoing to be real good friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.98,0:11:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Stubble, but\Nyour request is denied.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.28,0:11:53.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.20,0:11:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was dicey for a minute,\Nbut we still got the job done.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.38,0:11:59.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember to cut those\Ntongues off, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.00,0:12:02.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll turn them in at\Nthe association later.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.70,0:12:05.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're welcome to join us if you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.20,0:12:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.54,0:12:08.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Afraid of getting your hands dirty?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.16,0:12:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.36,0:12:11.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the main reason i took this job was so i
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.12,0:12:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,could make you guys do\Nthat stuff you tyrant no
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.84,0:12:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fair you don't pay us enough you got some
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.56,0:12:19.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,serious guts talking to\Nyour captain that way
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.96,0:12:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these guys seem really\Ncomfortable with each other
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.46,0:12:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so filmina what do you\Nthink our next move is we
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.34,0:12:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,got a pretty good haul\Ntoday but it could be better
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.36,0:12:31.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we could get a lot more\Ngold if we went to the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.74,0:12:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,front lines to get more\Ntongues i understand what
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.62,0:12:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're trying to say but\Nwe were given a job to do
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.24,0:12:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that's guarding llamas\Nand boxo i know but come
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.80,0:12:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on vice captain you know\Nas well as i do we need
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.90,0:12:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,funds to run the group\Nand this is the best way
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.28,0:12:49.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i was gonna give you all\Na bonus if we pulled it
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.12,0:12:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,off too oh what a shame\Ntruly such a shame have
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.54,0:12:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it your way captain we can\Ngo to the front lines if
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.58,0:12:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you want but we're not\Ngoing to do this unless
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.34,0:13:02.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,llamas and boxo agree to\Nit obviously what kind of
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.66,0:13:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,monster do you think i am\Nyou keep on worrying this
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.28,0:13:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much and your wrinkles are\Ngoing to get even worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.86,0:13:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try taking it easy once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.42,0:13:11.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vice-Captain Phil Mina,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.28,0:13:14.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,feel free to take a swing at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.84,0:13:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On that note, would you like to\Ncome to the front lines with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.34,0:13:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.74,0:13:20.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.68,0:13:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be so much fun on the front lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.92,0:13:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've seen what you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.14,0:13:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you want to fight them, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.72,0:13:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.12,0:13:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you think Boxxo and I can be of use\Nthere, then I know what my decision is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.96,0:13:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get there before\Nsomeone else is all the fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.26,0:13:36.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You okay with that, Boxxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.20,0:13:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.16,0:13:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That takes care of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.04,0:13:53.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to get all these\Ninjured people into the wagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.58,0:13:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to be okay. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.82,0:13:58.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.38,0:14:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These guys got hurt\Nfighting for the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.92,0:14:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there something I can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.94,0:14:03.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.10,0:14:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.60,0:14:10.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could even win a reward!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.42,0:14:13.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want me to pass these items\Nout to the wounded hunters?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.38,0:14:14.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.64,0:14:17.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the very least, I\Ncan keep them hydrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.54,0:14:20.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feel free to drink as\Nmuch as you like, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.48,0:14:21.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.39,0:14:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.12,0:14:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're a lifesaver.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.04,0:14:29.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was nice of you, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.92,0:14:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.06,0:14:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the assistance, Kerioyl.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.00,0:14:37.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just the kind of work I expect\Nfrom the Menagerie of Fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.48,0:14:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Menagerie of Fools?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.12,0:14:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a weird name for a group.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.00,0:14:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We had a little time on our hands, but\Nyou could have gotten by without us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.04,0:14:48.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true, we would have won the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.26,0:14:51.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though your cooperation is\Nappreciated all the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.58,0:14:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you think of a reason\Nwe were confronted with
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.74,0:14:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so many more frog fiends\Nthan we expected to face?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.86,0:15:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've only got one guess, and I\Ndon't think you're going to like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.64,0:15:03.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you guys having some\Nsecret meeting, or...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.18,0:15:04.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're still speculating,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.86,0:15:06.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but evidence is beginning to mount that a
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.46,0:15:09.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,King Frog Fiend was born\Nthis breeding season.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.10,0:15:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A King Frog Fiend?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.96,0:15:11.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.12,0:15:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really hope we don't\Ncome across that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.66,0:15:18.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hired your team to act as\Nbodyguards for Lamas and Boxo,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.40,0:15:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but if we really are dealing\Nwith a King Frog Fiend,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.98,0:15:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that changes things drastically.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.74,0:15:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I have no choice\Nbut to ask for your help. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.54,0:15:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A nasty job like this is just\Nperfect for the Menagerie of Fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.28,0:15:31.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.19,0:15:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll need food.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.48,0:15:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I count on the two of you for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.54,0:15:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you and Boxxo\Nwilling to keep the group
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.46,0:15:39.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,supplied while we search\Nfor the King Frog Fiend?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.50,0:15:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what Boxxo and I do best.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.52,0:15:49.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, anyone available to\Ngive me a hand over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.26,0:15:52.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll be right there. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.84,0:15:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta leave you alone for a little\Nwhile, but don't you cry while I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.64,0:15:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.20,0:16:00.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.11,0:16:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fine, don't miss me, but I'm going to\Nremember this the next time you're lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.32,0:16:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was the kind of conversation a\Nflesh-and-blood person would have with a lover.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.60,0:16:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sadly, I am but a vending machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.16,0:16:12.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.78,0:16:15.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, who's this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.50,0:16:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey, are you\Ntrying to steal my money?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.94,0:16:20.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.62,0:16:25.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, if you don't stop making noise,\NI'm going to destroy you, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.00,0:16:27.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.22,0:16:29.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep them coming, you freak of nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.10,0:16:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is this so damn hot? Ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.86,0:16:38.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about some extra hot corn\Nsoup for my favorite customer?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.00,0:16:39.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.91,0:16:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You dumb-ass box!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.00,0:16:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just made your last mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.56,0:16:43.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.20,0:16:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, am I interrupting something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.34,0:16:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, please, let me explain!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.02,0:17:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't cause any more trouble.\NYou reap what you sow, jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.84,0:17:19.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the King Throat Pete what\Nthe hell's it doing over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.42,0:17:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know but it looks pissed off
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.56,0:17:25.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.84,0:17:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.64,0:17:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's get you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.10,0:17:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit, I can't get the Unasusu to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.00,0:17:36.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to find a way to\Nget this wagon moving now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.66,0:17:37.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.08,0:17:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it'll all be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.58,0:17:48.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.70,0:17:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought she was going to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.38,0:17:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.96,0:17:53.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you cut them loose?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.40,0:17:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cause I'm not too scared to pull!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.72,0:18:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you serious? We're moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.88,0:18:07.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, what do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.68,0:18:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could probably protect Lamas with her\Nbarrier, but I can't cover the whole wagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.80,0:18:12.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.71,0:18:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'd never forgive me if I\Nsaved her and let the others die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.16,0:18:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need another idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.26,0:18:22.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do I have anything in my inventory\NI can use to slow it down?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.04,0:18:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, there's got to be\Nsomething I can do here!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:26.04,0:18:32.75,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (top to bottom),0,0,0,,{\an7}Apple Juice\NOrange Juice\NApple Juice\NOrange Juice\NGrape Juice\NPineapple Juice\NTomato Juice\NHoney Lemon\NEnergy Drink\NSoda Pop\NRamune\NCola\NDiet Cola\NZero Calorie Cola
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.82,0:18:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Something! Anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.38,0:18:31.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.54,0:18:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.22,0:18:39.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.92,0:18:41.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.18,0:18:43.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait, are you saying you\Nhave something that can help?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.88,0:18:44.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.02,0:18:46.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd come up with a plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.78,0:18:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand, but\Nit's better than nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.56,0:18:52.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I just gotta buy a new function.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.82,0:18:53.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Form change!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.36,0:19:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Boxxo, you got all\Nroundy! Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.00,0:19:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why hasn't she complimented\Nany of my other forms?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.94,0:19:13.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, so, uh, this thing fits\Ninto the plan somehow, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.10,0:19:15.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's the hard part.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.68,0:19:17.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How am I going to\Ncommunicate what she needs to
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.78,0:19:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do with everything now that\Nshe has all the pieces?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.58,0:19:21.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please insert coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.68,0:19:23.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please insert coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.38,0:19:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please insert coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.68,0:19:25.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.59,0:19:26.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want me to pay you right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.51,0:19:28.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't really have time for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.24,0:19:29.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.15,0:19:30.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please insert coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.22,0:19:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please insert coins. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.22,0:19:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.64,0:19:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, but I don't\Nknow what else to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.32,0:19:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is too much for a vending\Nmachine to communicate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.76,0:19:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta move.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.98,0:19:43.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think this thing is just busted.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.12,0:19:45.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.50,0:19:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's trying to tell me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.22,0:19:49.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And whatever it is, I know it's important!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.98,0:19:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's putting so much faith in me,\Nbut there's nothing more I can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.78,0:19:56.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Lamas, give up\Non the plan and run!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.82,0:19:59.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I take these things and\Nthen do something with coins?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.00,0:20:00.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.34,0:20:05.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell did I just wake up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.32,0:20:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys gotta untie me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.62,0:20:08.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'm\Ngonna die here with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.40,0:20:09.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.76,0:20:15.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, you idiot, I'm a good\Nplace of water, hurry, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.84,0:20:17.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drink this and calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.32,0:20:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.82,0:20:26.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.90,0:20:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of drink explodes?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.58,0:20:29.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It hurts my eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.98,0:20:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.10,0:20:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a well-known\Nphenomenon where I come from,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.40,0:20:34.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's completely unknown to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.98,0:20:39.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you put a certain minty candy into\Ncola, the results are shocking to behold.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.38,0:20:40.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.29,0:20:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just have to put this\Ncandy into this drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.12,0:20:43.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.24,0:20:45.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard him, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.40,0:20:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.70,0:20:51.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.50,0:20:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now aim for the eyes and fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.98,0:21:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the world's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.94,0:21:03.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.85,0:21:05.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to help Blomas and Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.74,0:21:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Already honored.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.80,0:21:09.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.08,0:21:17.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, it's finally over!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.42,0:21:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.54,0:21:20.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We owe it all to you, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.04,0:21:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.14,0:21:28.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas, when we couldn't find\Nthe wagon at the meeting point,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.88,0:21:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we were scared to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.28,0:21:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, Director. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.64,0:21:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your actions kept those\Nhunters alive and safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.06,0:21:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would never ask you\Nto apologize for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.60,0:21:39.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fault is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.38,0:21:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if I had just stayed where you told us\Nto, then you would have found us easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.18,0:21:44.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.52,0:21:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The girl and the bear began to\Ntake turns bowing to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.24,0:21:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a surreal yet\Nstrangely heartwarming sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.98,0:21:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mission accomplished, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.92,0:21:54.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.48,0:21:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But until we reach the village,\Nthis is still an organized march.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.48,0:22:00.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay on your toes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.94,0:22:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.14,0:22:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.94,0:22:26.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.00,0:22:27.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next time
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.60,0:23:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you like me, I'll tell\Nyou when I'm going to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.74,0:23:24.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the dawn's early,\Nlet's go to sleep with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.38,0:23:29.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as you can see,\Nwe'll have a good dream.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:34.97,0:23:40.01,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,upper left text,0,0,0,,{\pos(51,65)\fs14}Next Time
Dialogue: 1,0:23:34.97,0:23:40.01,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,lower right text,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs19\pos(530,300)\fscx78}Rebuilding
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.60,0:23:39.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and look forward to serving you again.

